--- 
layout: default
title: DESN Archive
---

<section style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
    <h1>
        This is an archive of the DESN graduation showcase websites. The 4-year DESN program offers a Bachelor of Design, Specialized Honours degree. Established in 2023, it is a continuation of the 1999–2022 YSDN program, the archives of which inspired this site. You can find at YSDN graduation websites at <a href="https://ysdn.info/">ysdn.info</a>.
    </h1>
</section>

{% comment %} <section style="margin-bottom:3rem;"> {% endcomment %}
    {% comment %} <div style="display: grid; width: 100%; row-gap: 32px;"> {% endcomment %}

        {% for _year in _years %}
            <section style="display: flex; gap: 2px; width: 100%;">

                {% comment %} graduation year {% endcomment %}
                <p style="min-width: 100px; margin: 0; padding: 0;">{{ _year[1].year }}</p>
                
                <div style="display: inline-block; gap: 2px; min-width: 100px;">
                    <div style=width: 100%>
                        {% if _year[1].archivepublished == true %}
                            <a href="archives/{{ _year[1].year }}" style="margin: 0; padding: 0;">Archive</a>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>

                    <div style="width: 100%;">
                        {% if _year[1].sitelive == true %}
                            <a href="{{ _year[1].siteurl }}" target="_blank" style="margin: 0; padding: 0;">Live site</a>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; column-gap: 24px; line-height: auto; margin: 0; padding: 0">

                    {% assign graduates = _year[1].graduates %}
                    {% for graduate in graduates %}
                        <p style="display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap; margin: 0; padding: 0;">{{ graduate }}</p>
                    {% endfor %} 
                </div>
            </section>
        {% endfor %}
    {% comment %} </div> {% endcomment %}

{% comment %} </section> {% endcomment %}